      "created_at": "2018-01-04T22:28:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So a friend and I have been listening to the letters page and have gotten into the idea of playing through as many battles as we can in the proper order with the proper teams.</p><p>So I was wondering if people have tried to put together any lists of battles, basiclly a timeline of the utliverse.&nbsp; I understand there is a lot of information not out there, and that many villians were fought many times by different groups, or when they do mention a particular fight they often have not said who was in it.&nbsp;</p><p>But still, have people tried to put together a list?&nbsp; I know more will be added each week as the letters page comes out but would love to see what we know so far.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
