      "created_at": "2018-01-26T03:39:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So why not act as a crowd sourced fact check?</p>\n<p>I mean, how many times have people called Christopher and Adam on mistakes or incongruity so far?  You bet there’s not more to come?</p>\n<p>Yes, they made the lore, but that doesn’t mean they’re perfect at recalling every bit of it.   And with how many eyes are on these forums, we’re bound to catch something of note.</p>\n<p>I say go for it!  Full steam ahead and damn the torpedoes!</p>",
